  m_text: '<size=120%><b>The Battleground</b></size>

    Units automatically move
    forward and attack enemies they encounter.

    Push towards the enemy base while
    defending your own.


    <size=120%><b>Building Turrets</b></size>

    Turrets
    automatically attack enemies within their range.


    <b>To build:</b> Select
    a turret, then select a highlighted slot.


    <b>Need more slots?</b> Purchase
    another <b>Turret Slot</b>.


    <b>To sell:</b> Select <b>Sell</b>, then select
    a turret to receive <b>50% of its Gold cost</b> back.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
