  m_text: '<b>Objective</b>


    Destroy the enemy base while protecting your own.


    Train
    units, build turrets and earn resources as you fight.


    <b>Gold</b> is used
    to train units and build defences.

    <b>EXP</b> is used to evolve and activate
    Meteor Strike.


    Evolve into stronger eras, push your army forward and destroy
    the enemy base to win.'
