  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'THE BATTLEGROUND


    This is where all the action takes place.


    Once
    deployed, your units will automatically move towards the enemy base and attack
    enemies they encounter.


    Your base and the enemy base are located on opposite
    sides of the battlefield. Push your army forward while preventing enemy units
    from reaching your base.


    BUILDING TURRETS


    Turrets provide additional
    defence and will automatically attack enemies within their range.


    To build
    a turret:


    1. Select the turret you want from the action toolbar.

    2.
    Available turret slots on your base will be highlighted.

    3. Select a highlighted
    slot to build the turret.


    Need more space? Purchase an additional Turret
    Slot from the action toolbar.


    To remove a turret, select Sell and then
    select the turret you want to remove. You will receive 50% of its original Gold
    cost back.


    Suggested image: Screenshot of your base with the turret slots
    visible/highlighted, similar to the Age of War screenshot you showed.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
