      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Don''t solely rely only on turrets.</b>

    You still need units to
    push forward and destroy the enemy base.


    <b>Mix your units.</b>

    Different
    units have different strengths, so combine melee and ranged units.


    <b>Manage
    your Gold.</b>

    Keep some Gold available in case you suddenly need more units
    or defence.


    <b>Use Meteor Strike wisely.</b>

    It can save you from
    a dangerous wave, but the EXP could also be used to evolve.


    <Size=120%><b>Ready?
    Build your army, defend your base and destroy the enemy!</b></Size>'
