  m_text: "<Size=120%><b>Evolution</b></Size>\nDefeat enemies to earn EXP.\n\nSpend
    EXP to <b>Evolve</b> into the next era, unlocking stronger units and turrets.\nKeeping
    up with the enemy's evolution is important as the battle becomes harder.\n\n<Size=120%><b>Meteor
    Strike</b></Size>\nSpend EXP to rain meteors across the battlefield and damage
    enemy units.\nIt is useful against large enemy waves, but <b>cannot damage the
    enemy base</b>.\n\nUse it carefully \u2014 spending too much EXP on meteors can
    delay your next evolution."
